---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="OG Image Generator"
  description=""
  canonical=""
  hreflangs={[]}
>

  
<div>
<div class="og-image" id="og-image">
<div class="content">
<div class="logo">
<span class="logo-icon">🎧</span>Audicap
        </div>
<div class="tagline">Real-time Audio Transcription</div>
<div class="features">
<span class="feature">🌍 Multi-language</span>
<span class="divider"></span>
<span class="feature">🌐 Real-time Translation</span>
<span class="divider"></span>
<span class="feature">✨ AI Summary</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="instructions">
<h3>如何保存为 PNG：</h3>
<ol>
<li>在浏览器中打开此页面</li>
<li>右键点击上方的图片区域</li>
<li>选择"检查"或按 F12 打开开发者工具</li>
<li>在 Elements 面板中找到 <code>class="og-image"</code> 的 div</li>
<li>右键 → "Capture node screenshot"</li>
<li>保存为 <code>og-share.png</code></li>
</ol>
<p style="margin-top: 15px; color: #666;">
        或者使用截图工具截取上方 1200x630 的区域。
      </p>
</div>
</div>

</Layout>
